      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我是以保健委员身份，\n来借身体检查要用的东西──\n不知道你时间上方便吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "825e3b286b10c8f3f9572f91e38719a11b1c2f8ce4e5d43d8ae2c62edc71d644",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
