      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后生野狄杜斯也以总务委员身份，\n利落地完成工作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ce0c33166ab11352378d8e87428371c272d1254de1b9dc216439d3c7efa7f48",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
